{"id": "31094", "title": "神秘雇佣兵悲壮命运：猎人突击队锋芒篇", "author": "信周", "category": "历史军事", "count": 30, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/31/31094.htm", "intro": "前无去路，后有追兵，走投无路之下，“猎人们”仓惶进入那一片远离文明的热带丛林。在一种完全孤立的处境中，一边是精锐的雇佣兵战士，一边是悍不畏死的恐怖分子，最先进的武器、最勇猛的战士、最危险的任务和最残酷的激战，一场你死我活的丛林游击战火爆上演……从此，开始了他们悲壮惨烈、无可奈何的另一种命运。良知和生存——这种痛苦而无奈的生活方式和魂萦梦牵的归国情怀，成为这群流浪金三角的国人心中永远的痛……你将进入一个真实的战场，加入一场正在进行的战争。", "base": "files/article/html/31/31094", "chapters": [{"title": "第一卷重披战袍", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一回", "file": "2009264.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二回", "file": "2009265.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三回", "file": "2009266.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四回", "file": "2009267.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五回", "file": "2009268.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六回", "file": "2009269.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七回", "file": "2009270.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八回", "file": "2009271.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二卷初露锋芒", "volume": true}, {"title": "第 九 回", "file": "2009273.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十回", "file": "2009274.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一回", "file": "2009275.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二回", "file": "2009276.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三回", "file": "2009277.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四回", "file": "2009278.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五回", "file": "2009279.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六回", "file": "2009280.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七回", "file": "2009281.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八回", "file": "2009282.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九回", "file": "2009283.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十回", "file": "2009284.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一回", "file": "2009285.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二回", "file": "2009286.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三回", "file": "2009287.html", "available": false}, {"title"